f them stabbed him in  the gut with a sword of ice and he left  benjin to die and to turn into a white  thankfully the children of the forest  found benjin before that happened they  saved him before the night Kings magic  could take hold the interesting thing is  they saved him using the exact same  method they used to create the night  king they shove dragon glass into  benjin's chest which prevented the night  king from binding him to as well  now benjin appears to be half human and  half white but what is he really and can  he still be killed by the others the  last time we saw benjin was right before  the season 7 finale John and his  companions went beyond the wall to  capture a white but they were surrounded  and nearly killed until Daenerys showed  up with her dragons to save them as John  was running to get on the dragon he was  tackled by several whites and they fell  into the lake  Daenerys had to leave him because the  night King was taking aim to kill  another one of her dragons when Johnny  merges from the lake the White's either  sense him or they hear him and they turn  around and start running at him but  benjin shows up just in time to save the  day he gives John his horse and he sends  him on his way and as John looks over  his shoulder he sees benjin is  surrounded and being overwhelmed by  whites it didn't appear as if Benjamin  was gonna make it out of there but does  this mean we won't see him again I think  before anyone just assumes benjin is  gone for good there is a few things we  should consider before we jump to any  conclusions  when benjin reappeared in the show  during season 6 he was technically a  completely different character the  Benjen stark we now know is loosely  based off a character from the books who  goes by the name of cold hands the  character in the books also helps brain  and Meera but he was a little more  involved and there are also a few  interesting things to learn about the  character uncle Benjen and cold hands  